{
  "sn6.10:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 6.10 ",
  "sn6.10:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn6.10:0.3": "Kokālikasutta ",
  "sn6.10:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn6.10:1.2": "Atha kho kokāliko bhikkhu yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho kokāliko bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn6.10:1.3": "“pāpicchā, bhante, sāriputtamoggallānā pāpikānaṁ icchānaṁ vasaṁ gatā”ti. ",
  "sn6.10:1.4": "Evaṁ vutte, bhagavā kokālikaṁ bhikkhuṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn6.10:1.5": "“mā hevaṁ, kokālika, avaca; mā hevaṁ, kokālika, avaca. ",
  "sn6.10:1.6": "Pasādehi, kokālika, sāriputtamoggallānesu cittaṁ. Pesalā sāriputtamoggallānā”ti. ",
  "sn6.10:1.7": "Dutiyampi kho kokāliko bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn6.10:1.8": "“kiñcāpi me, bhante, bhagavā saddhāyiko paccayiko; atha kho pāpicchāva bhante, sāriputtamoggallānā pāpikānaṁ icchānaṁ vasaṁ gatā”ti. ",
  "sn6.10:1.9": "Dutiyampi kho bhagavā kokālikaṁ bhikkhuṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn6.10:1.10": "“mā hevaṁ, kokālika, avaca; mā hevaṁ, kokālika, avaca. ",
  "sn6.10:1.11": "Pasādehi, kokālika, sāriputtamoggallānesu cittaṁ. Pesalā sāriputtamoggallānā”ti. ",
  "sn6.10:1.12": "Tatiyampi kho kokāliko bhikkhu bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn6.10:1.13": "“kiñcāpi …pe… icchānaṁ vasaṁ gatā”ti. ",
  "sn6.10:1.14": "Tatiyampi kho bhagavā kokālikaṁ bhikkhuṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn6.10:1.15